error[trioxide(wasm-ineligible)]: `getN` is forced into WASM but can't be compiled: reads `N`, which the analysis can't prove is initialised whenever this runs (a read before its declaration throws)
  --> input.ts:4:10 `N`
      `getN` reads `N`, which the analysis can't prove is initialised whenever this runs (a read before its declaration throws)
  help: only numbers, booleans, typed arrays, `number[]`, plain-data objects, local control flow, arithmetic, `Math.*` and calls to other compilable functions can be compiled (docs/PLAN.md §5); remove the directive to keep it in JS
